WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:04.033
-Our next guest has her new
stand-up special, "Menoplause,"

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:07.067
available for pre-order
on Apple TV.

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.167
Please welcome the very funny
Jackie Fabulous!

00:00:10.167 --> 00:00:11.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.901 --> 00:00:17.000
♪♪

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.634
-Whoo!

00:00:19.634 --> 00:00:21.501
Ah.

00:00:21.501 --> 00:00:24.234
Aw.
Sit down, sit down, sit down.

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:26.100
I'm getting married
in September.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.534
Yay!

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:29.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:29.534 --> 00:00:31.701
And in the beginning,
we were together all the time.

00:00:31.701 --> 00:00:34.501
He was really romantic
when lockdown started.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.067
He was like,
"Do you have any idea

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:37.334
how beautiful your smile is?"

00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:38.934
After about two years,
he's like,

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.934
"Are those all your real teeth?"

00:00:41.934 --> 00:00:43.767
He's a jealous guy.
I let him know like, "Look.

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.300
We're gonna be together
all the time.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.234
But you should know
when the world opens up...

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:49.033
I'm always surrounded by men.

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.968
45, 50 years old and up.
Attractive.

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:52.767
Are you gonna be okay
with that?"

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:54.267
And he was like,
"Jackie, I'm not gonna lie.

00:00:54.267 --> 00:00:55.534
I'm worried
when you go back to work

00:00:55.534 --> 00:00:57.000
I might not be enough for you.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.033
You might cheat on me
with one of your friends."

00:00:59.033 --> 00:01:01.033
I said, "You think
if I get a guy on the side,

00:01:01.033 --> 00:01:03.801
he'll be another
50-year-old man?"

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:05.300
If I get a guy on the side,

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.100
he gonna be half your age,
you fool."

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.534
Hav-- [ Laughs ]

00:01:10.534 --> 00:01:11.767
[ Applause ]

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:13.133
Oh.

00:01:13.133 --> 00:01:15.100
Having two boyfriends
that are both 50?

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:17.000
That's like having
two part-time jobs

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.300
and they're both at Chipotle.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.501
We go back and forth
about exercise, you know.

00:01:24.501 --> 00:01:26.934
He's in shape. I'm a shape.

00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:29.968
And he wants us to work out,
exercise, be the track --

00:01:29.968 --> 00:01:31.634
matching track-suit couple.

00:01:31.634 --> 00:01:34.701
And I would rather die.
Because I'm sparing him.

00:01:34.701 --> 00:01:36.868
When I lose any amount of
weight, I become unbearable.

00:01:36.868 --> 00:01:38.701
I look in the mirror,
I see Halle Berry.

00:01:38.701 --> 00:01:40.000
I'm also an actor.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.400
I got to find confidence
someplace, right?

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:45.701
I joined a weight-loss program
two years ago

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:48.601
and lost like 70 pounds on
this weight-loss program, right?

00:01:48.601 --> 00:01:50.601
And I gained it back.
Put your hand down, sir.

00:01:50.601 --> 00:01:52.267
I gained it back.
That's not the point.

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:53.734
The point is,
when I first joined,

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:55.234
I was down 2 pounds right away.

00:01:55.234 --> 00:01:57.367
But the problem was,
I thought I was J.Lo.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.300
You know how you lose 2 pounds?
You're like, "Oh, my God.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.734
You can barely see me!
I'm wasting away!"

00:02:01.734 --> 00:02:04.767
I looked exactly the same.
And I was dating a fat guy.

00:02:04.767 --> 00:02:06.367
It doesn't matter,
but I was dating a fatty.

00:02:06.367 --> 00:02:07.901
So, look, I'm down 2 pounds.

00:02:07.901 --> 00:02:10.667
I can't be seen
with a fat guy anymore.

00:02:10.667 --> 00:02:12.601
And he's like,
"Why can't you be with a fatty?"

00:02:12.601 --> 00:02:14.167
"You're huge.
You can barely see me.

00:02:14.167 --> 00:02:16.033
I can't be with a fat guy."

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:17.400
And he's like
"Yeah, I'm a fat guy,

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.267
but I have a big penis
and I pay for everything.

00:02:19.267 --> 00:02:21.234
What else do you need?"

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:23.434
"Nothing. My bad. Sorry!

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:25.534
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:26.868
Oh. Love you!

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:29.634
You know I talk crazy
when I'm hungry. Hey."

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:31.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.334 --> 00:02:33.300
The love of my life.
He's from New York.

00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:35.467
I used to live in California
for 20 years.

00:02:35.467 --> 00:02:37.901
I just figured out
who our mayor was. Mayor Adams.

00:02:37.901 --> 00:02:39.267
I bought a car.

00:02:39.267 --> 00:02:42.067
Not on the subway anymore.
And I'm scared.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:43.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:45.634
And Mayor Adams has a plan

00:02:45.634 --> 00:02:48.033
that I read online
to combat all this crime, right?

00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:49.667
And I'm like --
it wasn't a joke.

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:51.501
There was no LOL.
It was his real plan.

00:02:51.501 --> 00:02:53.234
Here's Mayor Adams' plan.
Alright?

00:02:53.234 --> 00:02:58.033
He said there will be
no more smoking on the subway.

00:02:58.033 --> 00:03:02.667
There will be no more sleeping
on the subway.

00:03:02.667 --> 00:03:07.834
There will be no more
doing drugs on the subway.

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:12.000
There will be no more
doing barbecues on the subway.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.801
Who in the hell is barbecuing
on the damn subway? Who?!

00:03:15.801 --> 00:03:17.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:17.467 --> 00:03:19.067
Show yourselves.

00:03:19.067 --> 00:03:21.334
[ Applause ]

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:24.200
And my question, Mayor Adams,
was that the last straw?

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.667
Was that why you decided
you wanted to have a plan

00:03:26.667 --> 00:03:28.167
to combat all of the crime?

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:30.267
'Cause, look, there is a lot
of violence on the train,

00:03:30.267 --> 00:03:33.067
but let's -- what if we just try
and have barbecues

00:03:33.067 --> 00:03:34.801
and get rid of all the violence?

00:03:34.801 --> 00:03:36.367
Wouldn't you want to see
a big Black lady

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:37.767
on the train making ribs?

00:03:37.767 --> 00:03:39.267
I would.

00:03:39.267 --> 00:03:40.934
Be hungry after all that,

00:03:40.934 --> 00:03:43.367
you know, sleeping and robbing
and smoking and stuff.

00:03:43.367 --> 00:03:45.100
Need a snack.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.467
I'm better suited to be in New
York, though. My personality.

00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:50.467
In California, I got accused
of being too blunt.

00:03:50.467 --> 00:03:51.834
California
is what you think it is.

00:03:51.834 --> 00:03:53.868
It's all about kale
and horoscopes.

00:03:53.868 --> 00:03:55.467
That's what California's about.
Right?

00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:58.100
And I had my handful of bags
going to my car.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:03:59.634
This lady's like,
"Will you please sign

00:03:59.634 --> 00:04:01.734
our petition for animal rights?"

00:04:01.734 --> 00:04:03.000
I said, "Animals?"

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.868
Flipped her off
and I walked away, okay?

00:04:04.868 --> 00:04:06.834
If you love animals,
you're doing a great job.

00:04:06.834 --> 00:04:09.367
I don't have time
to fight for animals.

00:04:09.367 --> 00:04:12.000
Animals, Black people,
Black women, women.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:14.467
That's a long list. I don't got
that kind of time, okay?

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:16.334
I can't do it
because I am a Black woman.

00:04:16.334 --> 00:04:17.968
I'm full-figured. I'm divorced.

00:04:17.968 --> 00:04:19.901
I still want to have a baby
at my age.

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:21.467
How? You know, I don't know.

00:04:21.467 --> 00:04:23.133
I grow one hair
out of this nipple

00:04:23.133 --> 00:04:24.801
that when I pull it out
on Monday,

00:04:24.801 --> 00:04:26.133
it's back to this again
on Tuesday.

00:04:26.133 --> 00:04:27.334
How?

00:04:27.334 --> 00:04:28.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:30.834
[ Applause ]

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:36.400
Every time I laugh or sneeze,
a little bit of pee comes out.

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.734
Yay. I'm horny all the time.
Don't know why.

00:04:38.734 --> 00:04:40.701
I look pregnant
no matter what I have on.

00:04:40.701 --> 00:04:43.033
And this is not a baby.
This is gravy and frosting.

00:04:43.033 --> 00:04:45.267
I don't know what this is.

00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:47.067
And the most fun
that I'm having,

00:04:47.067 --> 00:04:48.534
I grow a goatee
every three days.

00:04:48.534 --> 00:04:50.200
Got to hell with your petition,
ma'am.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.634
Who's fighting for my rights?

00:04:51.634 --> 00:04:53.501
I don't have time to help you
and the animals of America.

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:55.300
[ Applause ]

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.100
[ Laughs ]

00:04:58.100 --> 00:05:02.367
Ah. I'm Jackie Fabulous.
Thank you, guys, so much.

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.100
♪♪

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.767
-Frosting. Gravy and frosting.
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:10.734
-Jackie Fabulous!

00:05:10.734 --> 00:05:12.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

